---
import DefaultLayout from "../../layouts/default.astro";
---

<DefaultLayout title="Naviget Driver Privacy Policy">
    <div class="pt-[15vh]">
        <div class="border-default p-6 mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl tracking-wider justify-around md:p-12">
            <h1 class="mb-4 text-4xl tracking-tight text-heading md:text-6xl">
                Meter Raja and Driver App Privacy Policy
            </h1>
            <p class="font-normal text-body mb-3">
                Last Updated: 20 September 2026
            </p>
            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                Meter Raja are Naviget Driver application (“the App(s)”) are a
                application developed and owned by Stepzero Labs Private Limited
                (“Company”, “we”, “our”, or “us”). This Privacy Policy describes
                how we collect, use, disclose, and protect your information when
                you use the Apps.
            </p>
            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                By downloading, accessing, or using the apps, you agree to the
                terms of this Privacy Policy.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-heading text-3xl mb-2 mt-4">
                1. Information We Collect
            </h2>

            <h3 class="text-heading text-xl mb-2 mt-4">
                1.1 Information You Provide
            </h3>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Required information: Name, phone number, vehicle number,
                    permit/registration details. If applicable.
                </li>

                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Optional Information: Government ID, payment method and bank
                    payout information.
                </li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="text-heading text-xl mb-2 mt-4">
                1.2 Automatically Collected Information
            </h3>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Location Information: We collect real-time location data in
                    foreground and background, even when the app is closed or
                    not in use to accurately calculate distance, fares, and
                    duration of ride.
                </li>
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Device Information: Device model, operating system, app
                    version, IP address, and diagnostic information.
                </li>
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Usage Data: Actions taken inside the app, location session
                    logs and transmission over network, and crash data.
                </li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-heading text-2xl mb-2 mt-4">
                2. How We Use Your Information
            </h2>

            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                We use the collected information to:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Accurately calculate distance, time, and fares.
                </li>

                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    If being used by a Naviget driver, transmit real-time over
                    network.
                </li>

                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Improve app accuracy, performance, and security.
                </li>

                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Provide customer support and resolve issues.
                </li>

                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Prevent fraud, misuse, and ensure compliance with local
                    transport regulations.
                </li>

                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Generate analytics to improve service quality.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                We do not sell, or trade your personal information.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-heading text-2xl mb-2 mt-4">
                3. Location Data Usage
            </h2>

            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                We require precise location access to show accurate distance and
                time readings.
            </p>

            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                If the apps are being used by a Naviget driver, we additionally
                require precise location to:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Transmit location over network for operations and
                    record-keeping
                </li>
            </ul>

            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                Location data is collected only when user explicitly enables it
                and is not used for marketing.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-heading text-2xl mb-2 mt-4">
                4. Sharing of Information
            </h2>

            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                We may share information with thirrd parties only in the
                following cases:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Service Providers: For analytics, crash reporting, and
                    backend hosting (e.g., Firebase, AWS).
                </li>
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Legal Compliance: If required by law, courts, or government
                    authorities.
                </li>
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Business Transfers: In the event of a merger, acquisition,
                    or restructuring of the Company.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                We do not share personal identifiable information with
                advertisers or marketing platforms.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-heading text-2xl mb-2 mt-4">
                5. Data Storage & Security
            </h2>

            <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Data is stored securely on encrypted servers managed by us
                    or our trusted cloud providers.
                </li>
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    We implement industry-standard security measures including
                    encryption, secure servers, and access controls.
                </li>
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    While we take strong precautions, no system is completely
                    secure.
                </li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-heading text-2xl mb-2 mt-4">6. Data Retention</h2>

            <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    User can request data deletion by contacting us on email
                    provided on our website.
                </li>

                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Some data may be retained if required by law.
                </li>

                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    For Naviget's drivers - trip logs, location data, and driver
                    details are retained even after account is inactive.
                </li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-heading text-2xl mb-2 mt-4">
                7. Children’s Privacy
            </h2>

            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                The app is intended for adults who use taxis. We do not
                knowingly collect data from children under 18.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-heading text-2xl mb-2 mt-4">
                8. Third-Party Links
            </h2>

            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                The app may contain external links. We do not endorse or assume
                responsibility for third-party links.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-heading text-2xl mb-2 mt-4">9. Your Rights</h2>

            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">You may:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Request access to your data
                </li>
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Request correction of inaccurate details
                </li>
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Request deletion of your account and related data, subject
                    to Section 6.
                </li>
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Withdraw permissions (such as location access)
                </li>
                <li class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                    Contact us for privacy-related queries
                </li>
            </ul>

            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                To exercise these rights, email us at:
                <a href="mailto:hello@naviget.in">hello@naviget.in</a>
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-heading text-2xl mb-2 mt-4">
                10. Changes to This Privacy Policy
            </h2>

            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                We may update this policy occasionally. Continued use of the app
                after changes means you accept the updated policy.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-heading text-2xl mb-2 mt-4">11. Contact Us</h2>

            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                For any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy,
                contact:
            </p>

            <p class="md:text-lg font-normal text-body">
                Stepzero Labs Private Limited <br />
                Email: <a href="mailto:hello@naviget.in">hello@naviget.in</a>
                Website: naviget.in
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</DefaultLayout>
